WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.441
Click! Flash!

2
00:00:03.442 --> 00:00:08.762
The bright light kept flashing.

3
00:00:08.763 --> 00:00:14.029
"What's happening?" Mo said.

4
00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:17.784
"I'm not sure," Cora said.

5
00:00:17.785 --> 00:00:21.835
Then something even stranger happened.

6
00:00:21.836 --> 00:00:24.312
The diver opened the net.

7
00:00:24.313 --> 00:00:28.867
He let Cora and Mo go!

8
00:00:28.868 --> 00:00:32.099
They swam fast to Mandy.

9
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:37.106
"Whew!" Mo said. "That was scary!"

10
00:00:37.107 --> 00:00:40.133
"You're safe now," Mandy said.

11
00:00:40.134 --> 00:00:45.330
"Yes, but . . ." Cora looked at Mandy's fin.

12
00:00:45.331 --> 00:00:48.573
"We have to remove that hook."

13
00:00:48.574 --> 00:00:51.212
Cora didn't know what to do.

14
00:00:51.213 --> 00:00:53.572
But Mo was watching something.

15
00:00:53.573 --> 00:00:56.248
"Cora! Look at the arrow!

16
00:00:56.249 --> 00:01:00.451
It's pointing at the diver again."

17
00:01:00.452 --> 00:01:05.820
Mandy frowned. "Humans are dangerous.

18
00:01:05.821 --> 00:01:08.735
Why is it pointing at that diver?"

19
00:01:08.736 --> 00:01:12.029
"I think I know why!" Cora cried.

20
00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:17.590
"Follow me!"

21
00:01:17.591 --> 00:01:22.210
They swam back to the diver.

22
00:01:22.211 --> 00:01:26.698
Cora pointed to Mandy's fin.

23
00:01:26.699 --> 00:01:32.371
The diver nodded and swam to Mandy.

24
00:01:32.372 --> 00:01:39.907
Gently the diver removed the hook!

25
00:01:39.908 --> 00:01:45.879
"Thank you!" Mandy said.

26
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:50.415
The three friends went back to Cora's den.

27
00:01:50.416 --> 00:01:54.410
"I'm glad that human was so nice," Mo said.

28
00:01:54.411 --> 00:01:57.445
"Me too," Mandy said.

29
00:01:57.446 --> 00:02:00.087
"Should I look for some rocks now?"

30
00:02:00.088 --> 00:02:06.748
"Yes." Cora grinned. "But this time, remember.

31
00:02:06.749 --> 00:02:13.892
Rocks, not hooks!"

